<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Orang Laut</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Orang Laut, or sea people, are communities of maritime nomads who have long lived on boats in the waters around <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sumatra">Sumatra</a>, the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/riau">Riau</a> islands and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/malay-peninsula">Malay Peninsula</a>. They formed the core naval force of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/srivijaya">Srivijaya Empire</a>. Their seamanship and local knowledge made them effective in policing the straits, and Srivijaya secured their loyalty through material patronage rather than conventional military service.</p></div>
